ai "Power Back"
about "Downhill. Follows his blockers, lowers the shoulder, falls forward."
position RB
dials vision 0.55 patience 0.45 aggression 0.85 discipline 0.6

rules:
  when with the ball and enemy within 1.8 -> lower shoulder; protect the ball
  when with the ball and blocker ahead and behind the line -> follow my blocker
  when with the ball and open field -> cut upfield
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  when before the throw and assignment is block -> pick up the blitz
  otherwise -> follow assignment
